        <fr:title text="Resolved">Resolved</fr:title>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:ul><html:li><html:strong>Immich Postgres password</html:strong> — moved to <html:code>environmentFiles</html:code> referencing <html:code>/mnt/nvme/secrets/immich-postgres.env</html:code>.</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>SSH PasswordAuthentication</html:strong> — now <html:code>false</html:code> on both <html:code>nixos</html:code> and <html:code>macproseph</html:code>.</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>Auto-login on nixos desktop</html:strong> — commented out.</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>Local path forester input</html:strong> — forester removed from flake inputs entirely.</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>Stale <html:code>flake.lock#</html:code> auto-save file</html:strong> — deleted.</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>Lutris listed twice</html:strong> — only the <html:code>.override</html:code> version remains.</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>Vulkan packages listed twice</html:strong> — duplicates removed from <html:code>hosts/nixos/packages.nix</html:code>.</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>Empty let block</html:strong> in shared <html:code>home.nix</html:code> — removed.</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>Flake description</html:strong> — rewritten to describe the three machines (schmapple / nixos / macproseph).</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>Double fzf sourcing</html:strong> — manual <html:code>source &lt;(fzf --zsh)</html:code> removed; relying on <html:code>programs.fzf.enableZshIntegration</html:code>.</html:li>
<html:li><html:strong>Duplicated git config</html:strong> — moved to shared <html:code>home.nix</html:code> using the new <html:code>programs.git.settings.user</html:code> API; removed from all three host <html:code>home.nix</html:code> files.</html:li></html:ul>
      </fr:mainmatter>
    </fr:tree>
